│ Type the local kind cluster's name: Enter uses it and runs the checks again, Esc keeps the name it had. ? is part of │
│ a name here, so F1 opens help. Nothing has been changed yet: nothing on these screens changes anything until you     │
│ approve the plan on the review. Ctrl+C exits.                                                                        │
